<!--
  User-facing text, English (the fallback for every language).

  Kept as resources rather than literals in the composables so Android can pick
  the translation from the phone's own language setting — there is no language
  switch in the app, and there should not be one: the phone already knows.

  Ids are named after what the string *is*, not where it happens to appear, so
  moving a screen around does not turn every id into a lie.
-->
